sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant L as Lab SFTP server
  participant G as HL7 Edge Gateway
  participant M as MEDITECH
  Note over L: Lab uploads results-batch.hl7
  G->>L: list outbox (SFTP, key, host key checked)
  G->>L: list outbox again: file unchanged
  G->>L: read results-batch.hl7
  G->>G: split: LAB-7001, LAB-7002, LAB-7003, store each
  G->>M: LAB-7001 (MLLP)
  M-->>G: ACK AA
  G->>M: LAB-7002, then LAB-7003
  M-->>G: ACK AA, ACK AA
  G->>L: move to outbox/processed
  M->>G: ORM^O01 ORD-8001 (MLLP :7890)
  G-->>M: ACK AA (stored)
  G->>L: write orders_time.hl7.part (FHS, BHS, ORD-8001)
  M->>G: ORD-8002, ORD-8003
  G-->>M: ACK AA, ACK AA
  G->>L: append ORD-8002, ORD-8003
  G->>L: append BTS 3 and FTS, rename to orders_time.hl7
